&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Us&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At &lt;a href=&quot;http://prenuvo.com/&quot;&gt;Prenuvo&lt;/a&gt;, we are on a mission to flip the paradigm from reactive “sick-care” to proactive health care. Our award-winning whole body scan is fast (under 1 hour), safe (MRI has no ionizing radiation), and non-invasive (no contrast). Our unique integrated stack of optimized hardware, software, and increasingly AI, coupled with the patient-centric experience across our domestic and global clinics, have allowed us to lead the change against “we caught it too late again&quot;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are looking for a &lt;strong&gt;Senior Backend Engineer II - Data &lt;/strong&gt;to design, build, and maintain the data foundation that powers our clinical products and workflows.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is a software engineering role at its core. You will play a key role in building and evolving our Medical Data Server, working alongside the existing Medical Data Platform team across its Python services, APIs, database architecture, and production operations. You will also apply industry best practices to design the data models, integrations, and pipelines that make complex clinical information reliable and accessible across Prenuvo products.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will work with complex healthcare data, including FHIR and HL7, to build reliable data models, integrations, and pipelines. Your work will make clinical information accessible and trustworthy across clinical applications, reporting, analytics, and AI-enabled workflows.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;This role does not provide visa sponsorship. Applicants must be legally authorized to work in the United States at the time of hire and must not require employer sponsorship for a work visa (current or future).&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Help reshape the world through proactive healthcare while working with cutting-edge technology and high performing teams with deep expertise - join us to make a difference in people’s lives!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You’ll Do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Build and Evolve the Medical Data Server: &lt;/strong&gt;Collaborate with engineers across the Clinical Data team to design, build, and operate the Python backend services and RESTful APIs responsible for managing clinical data.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Clinical Data Architecture:&lt;/strong&gt; Partner closely with the Architecture team and other engineering stakeholders to design and evolve scalable clinical data models using healthcare interoperability standards such as FHIR and HL7. Help establish clear boundaries, ownership, and contracts across clinical data domains.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Data Pipeline Development:&lt;/strong&gt; Build and maintain reliable batch and event-driven pipelines that ingest, transform, validate, and deliver clinical data across operational systems, data platforms, reporting tools, and downstream applications.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Data Quality and Reliability:&lt;/strong&gt; Establish automated validation, testing, reconciliation, and monitoring to identify incomplete, inconsistent, duplicated, or incorrectly mapped clinical data before it affects users or downstream systems.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Data Modeling and Transformation:&lt;/strong&gt; Develop maintainable transformation layers and curated datasets that support clinical reporting, operational analytics, product functionality, and AI use cases.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Data Governance and Lineage:&lt;/strong&gt; Implement practices for data documentation, lineage, provenance, versioning, retention, and auditability. Help ensure clinical data remains trustworthy and explainable throughout its lifecycle.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Cross-Functional Collaboration:&lt;/strong&gt; Work closely with clinical, product, application engineering, architecture, data analytics, and AI teams to translate clinical workflows and business needs into durable technical solutions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Technical Leadership:&lt;/strong&gt; Lead design discussions, contribute to architectural decisions, review technical implementations, mentor engineers, and help establish engineering standards for clinical data development.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You’ll Bring&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Backend Engineering Experience: 6–8 years of software engineering experience, including ownership of production services and databases&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Python Expertise: Strong experience building production Python applications and APIs using frameworks such as FastAPI, Django, or Flask.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Data Engineering:&lt;/strong&gt; Experience designing and operating scalable ingestion, transformation, and delivery pipelines using batch, streaming, or event-driven patterns.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Healthcare Data:&lt;/strong&gt; Hands-on experience working with clinical or healthcare data, including a strong understanding of &lt;strong&gt;FHIR resources, HL7 standards, terminology, and interoperability challenges&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Data Modeling:&lt;/strong&gt; Experience designing normalized, dimensional, and domain-oriented data models. You understand how modeling decisions affect data quality, usability, and system performance.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Engineering Ownership:&lt;/strong&gt; Ability to independently lead complex initiatives, make sound technical decisions, and balance short-term delivery with long-term maintainability.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Nice to Have&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working with FHIR servers, clinical data repositories, electronic health record systems, or medical imaging and reporting workflows.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with healthcare terminology standards such as SNOMED CT, LOINC, ICD-10, or DICOM.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with cloud infrastructure, data pipelines, and clinical reporting or AI-enabled healthcare products.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Our Values&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;First: we are &lt;strong&gt;Pioneers&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Transforming healthcare requires divergent thinking, bias for action, disciplined experimentation, and consistent grit and determination to maintain momentum. This journey is as challenging as it is rewarding.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Second: we are &lt;strong&gt;Platform-Builders&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;We’re always building foundations that allow us to achieve tomorrow more than we did today. We never lose sight of what’s ahead – in a mindset of ownership and duty to our mission.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Above all: we are &lt;strong&gt;Patients&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;We could all be the next person who walks through our very doors, seeking clarity or peace of mind. We are proud of our impact on our patients’ lives, and we won’t stop till everyone can benefit from our work.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What We Offer&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;An avenue to make a positive impact on people&#39;s lives and their health&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;We believe in preventative healthcare for everyone, including our team - Prenuvo provides free, whole-body scans to each team member&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Growth opportunities are at the heart of our people journey, we’re doing big things with bright minds - there is no single path to success, it can be shaped along the way&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Building strong relationships is at the core of everything we do - our team gets together each week to connect, share, and socialize&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Recognizing time away to restore is vital to our wellbeing - we have a flexible vacation policy and we will encourage you to use it&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Prenuvo offers a 401(k) retirement savings plan to eligible employees, allowing team members to make pre-tax contributions toward their retirement. While Prenuvo facilitates access to the plan, the company does not currently offer matching contributions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;We offer a comprehensive benefits package including health, dental, vision, including Mental Health coverage, to support you and your family&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The base salary for this role is $165,000 to $180,000 in local currency, depending on experience and geographic location&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;We are an equal-opportunity employer and value diversity at our company. We do not discriminate on the basis of race, religion, color, national origin, gender, sexual orientation, age, marital status, veteran status, or disability status.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;As part of the hiring process, successful candidates will undergo a background check in compliance to applicable federal, provincial, and state rules.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Please be advised that official communication from our recruitment team will only come from our authorized domain [&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;http://prenuvo.com/&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;prenuvo.com&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;strong&gt;]. If you are contacted by a recruiter, please ensure their email address ends with @prenuvo.com. We do not use third-party recruitment services or any other email domains for hiring purposes. If you receive communication that you believe to be fraudulent, please report it immediately to jobs@prenuvo.com.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
